# Public showcase repository: track only these reviewed files.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/INSTALL.md
!/ARCHIVE_OLD_DEV_LOGS.md
!/Icon.png
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/LICENSE-imgui.txt
!/LICENSE-cimgui.txt

# Reviewed gameplay GIFs only. Keep source files and other media excluded.
!/media/
/media/*
!/media/tooltip-overlay.gif
!/media/quick-actions.gif
!/media/automation-chest.gif
!/media/storage-movement.gif
!/media/plot-planner.gif
!/media/player-wedding.gif

# Publish compiled ZIPs as GitHub Release assets, not repository files.
# Source code, internal engineering notes, build outputs, and backups stay private.
# ARCHIVE_OLD_DEV_LOGS.md is the reviewed public history, not a raw private log.
